			               													<description>From the description:

On the far banks of the River Dosk, the pastures, orchards, and open fields stretch away into the distance. Each farm glows with the sickly light of the radiant energy that allows plants to grow even in this night-shrouded world.  This is Barrowcleft, home to the farmers and labourers who toil for their whole lives in the near-barren soil and grow strange in their rural isolation. 

This unofficial, fan-made district guide helps you run games of Blades in the Dark set in the sprawling agricultural hinterland of Doskvol &amp;mdash; where the terrors of the Deathlands lurk just behind the back fence of the fields, and criminal gangs camp in the craggy hills and dense woods away from prying eyes.

It contains:

- The Landscape of Barrowcleft &amp;mdash; Tables to generate locations in the district for your crew&amp;rsquo;s scores
- Claims map &amp;mdash; Develop your own camp and cover operation as a criminal gang based in Doskvol&amp;rsquo;s rural hinterland
- Opportunities &amp;mdash; Make some coin among the villages and farms
- Bees in the dark &amp;mdash; a honey heist that pits the crew against the Ministry of Preservation as they steal a valuable cargo of beehives and race them to a buyer in the city

</description>
